        "## 2. Cleaning\n",
        "Funnel: 488 raw -> 457 with a structure and a value -> 403 exact values (54 censored removed) -> 402 in nM (1 ug/mL row removed) -> 402 positive numeric values -> 381 after excluding 21 non-comparable records.\n",
        "Exclusion (step 6): the 21 records of CHEMBL3044988, a QSAR re-analysis, report values for compounds also measured in the original paper (CHEMBL1143085) that differ by up to about 5 log units. They look transformed or predicted and are not comparable. They are saved to inha_excluded_records.csv."
